22044a7d0f65ac107a44972e5e4c_w13_h15.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/0d4622044a7d0f65ac107a44972e5e4c_w13_h15.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;  &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/0d4622044a7d0f65ac107a44972e5e4c_w13_h15.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:358437930439598</guid><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 02:17:56 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>[emo98]**Feature Update**[emo99] The latest version of the web and app (iOS 7.34.3, Android 6.97.0 (1170)) comes with two updates! **1. You can now do...</title><description>&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/35b5d84c20e6948352e2f6439b52f951_w32_h28.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;b&gt;Feature Update&lt;/b&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/2513977d4c4d074192a663da55f3ee8d_w32_h28.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;The latest version of the web and app (iOS 7.34.3, Android 6.97.0 (1170)) comes with two updates!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. You can now download individual emoticons from a pack!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Users without Plurk Coins can now search older content!&lt;/b&gt;</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:358350816990499</guid><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 05:15:02 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>[emo100]Feature Update[emo101] Plurk&#39;s **&quot;Simple Mode&quot;** on the web will be discontinued in the near future. Once the service ends, Simple Mode will n...</title><description>&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/29d66b735420470dca04633ae29e781f_w32_h28.gif&quot; re