er.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;Meaty has got a driver license...and it&#39;s ready to take plurkers out for a ride! &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/be9c38a8d03d1becd68030fe0a577aee_w27_h26.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;(link below)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://images.plurk.com/3bjMX5RncvIuBc4buUBAKh.png&quot; class=&quot;ex_link pictureservices&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://images.plurk.com/3bjMX5RncvIuBc4buUBAKh.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:357265303366237</guid><pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 01:32:07 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>[emo646]**Feature Update**[emo647] In the latest Plurk web and app (iOS 7.26.0、Android 6.89.1), the emoticon limit increased **from 1,250 to 1,500** ...</title><description>&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/a9f3f0e1ef239184cedaf079d137b240_w32_h28.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;b&gt;Feature Update&lt;/b&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/af6a413c76b27a68404ee9ac0ea76fc0_w32_h28.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;In the latest Plurk web and app (iOS 7.26.0、Android 6.89.1), the emoticon limit increased &lt;b&gt;from 1,250 to 1,500&lt;/b&gt; for Plurk Coin users &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/be9c38a8d03d1becd68030fe0a577aee_w27_h26.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;Also, we upgraded supported image resolution for Plurk Coin users:&lt;br&gt;For images under 2.5MB, will not be compressed, and for images over 2.5MB, the max could be 4096 px &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/35cafe2624b7f86e4b406318c4f10c19_w24_h24.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:357025372432068</guid><pubDate>Tue, 14 Apr 2026 08:51:07 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>[emo102]Feature Update[emo103] The latest Plurk app (iOS 7.25.0 / Android 6.88.2) now supports **mentions**! **Type @ in a plurk or response** to see ...</title><description>&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/7c5ba28af9495e1515e155dfb522e3ec_w32_h28.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; Feature Update &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/c5c3b6a9977c8533ddbcc05cb8326542_w32_h28.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;The latest Plurk app (iOS 7.25.0 / Android 6.88.2) now supports &lt;b&gt;mentions&lt;/b&gt;!&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type @ in a plurk or response&lt;/b&gt; to see all your friends in a list.&lt;br&gt;Select one to mention them in your post. They&#39;ll receive a notification after you publish the plurk or response. &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/be9c38a8d03d1becd68030fe0a577aee_w27_h26.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://images.plurk.com/42CnmjslKf8SSSF37WpmPT.png&quot; class=&quot;ex_link pictureservices&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://images.plurk.com/42CnmjslKf8SSSF37WpmPT.png&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:356955998483938</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Apr 2026 02:18:03 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>Plurk is about to celebrate 18th anniversary! We would love to invite all plurkers to join![emo716] **How to submit**: Please fill out https://forms.g...</title><description>Plurk is about to celebrate 18th anniversary!&lt;br&gt;We would love to invite all plurkers to join! &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon_my&quot; src=&quot;https://emos.plurk.com/f9689f2e904929fbd98bc1ba092c2dd5_w46_h30.gif&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to submit&lt;/b&gt;: Please fill out &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/MGm5EEe3EoovNf858&quot; class=&quot;ex_link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. You may choose to submit with preferred name or anonymously.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What to submit&lt;/b&gt;: No limits — anything you would like to say.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open time&lt;/b&gt;: until April 6, 04:00 (UTC+0).</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:356826386518958</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Mar 2026 09:01:29 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>【Plurk Coin Price Adjustment】 Hey Plurkers, Over the years, we&#39;ve been dedicated to make better social experience on Plurk. To keep Plurk growing, w...</title><description>【Plurk Coin Price Adjustment】&lt;br&gt;Hey Plurkers,&lt;br&gt;Over the years, we&#39;ve been dedicated to make better social experience on Plurk. To keep Plurk growing, we&#39;ll be adjusting the price of Plurk Coins.&lt;br&gt;The price per coin on the web will change from USD$2.19 to USD$2.75.&lt;br&gt;This adjustment is scheduled to take effect on April 15 at 04:00 UTC.</description><link/><guid isPermaLink="false">plurk:356801588842664</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 03:12:37 GMT</pubDate><author>Plurk EN</author></item><item><title>Starting from version 6.87.0 (1070), Plurk will no longer support Android 6.0 and below. Please upgrade to Android 7.0 or later to continue using the ...</title><description>Starting from version 6.87.0 (1070), Plurk will no longer support Android 6.0 and below.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;Please upgrade to Android 7.0 or later to continue using the app.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;double-br&quot;&gt;Some features may n